\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Exact objects that define the order-$668$ search problem. (a) The half-autocorrelation target vector $\tau $ for the unresolved length-$167$, weight-$80$ cyclic obstruction of \citet  {constantine2025cyclic}. (b) The signed nonzero combined aperiodic defects of the published mod-$64$ order-$668$ seed of \citet  {eliahou2025mod64}. The later literal cellar packet acts on canonical tail panels cut from the cyclic channel, but the seed-projection stress family is derived from the same modular anchor.\relax }}{14}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
