\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Reachability diagnostics for the precursor $\mathrm  {H1}$ packet. The CA rule visits fewer canonical orbits and reaches its best recorded state much earlier than the matched baseline, especially on the exact target. This early plateau is one of the reasons the repository stopped spending budget on flat support-space local dynamics and reopened the problem through a different information channel.\relax }}{17}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:h1-dynamics}{{3}{17}{Reachability diagnostics for the precursor $\mathrm {H1}$ packet. The CA rule visits fewer canonical orbits and reaches its best recorded state much earlier than the matched baseline, especially on the exact target. This early plateau is one of the reasons the repository stopped spending budget on flat support-space local dynamics and reopened the problem through a different information channel.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
